OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,8,Fand variable cloud, potentially rather
OL,9,Flow over the Pennines. Staying rather
OL,10,Fwarm in urban areas but cooler in the
OL,11,Fcountryside by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FDry with some variable cloud
OL,14,Faround at times, the odd shower should
OL,15,Fnot be ruled out through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. feeling very warm once
OL,17,Fagain with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
