OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FApart
OL,6,Ffrom a few showers, the weekend will
OL,7,Fbe largely dry with some sunshine. A
OL,8,Fband of rain then likely to move in
OL,9,Fduring Monday. Temperatures nearer to
OL,10,Faverage.
